# AGENTS.md — Mandatory Rules

`AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the **highest-authority** file in this repository.
Every agent, skill, and sub-agent MUST obey it. Rules are **blocking**: if a change
violates AGENTS.md, do not proceed — fix it or stop and surface it to the user.

Before any dbt work (models, macros, tests, specs):

1. **Read** `AGENTS.md` when you need rule details (layers, naming, tests, materializations).
2. **Validate** every change against AGENTS.md before marking work complete.
3. **Never restate** AGENTS.md rules in other files — point to it instead.

The spec-driven workflow skill orchestrates phases; AGENTS.md holds the engineering rules.
Canonical skill: `{{PLUGIN_ROOT}}/skills/spec-driven/SKILL.md`.
